### Teste de Login com dados inválidos (deve retornar 401)
POST http://localhost:40001/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "usuario_invalido",
    "password": "senha_invalida"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### Teste de Logout
POST http://localhost:40001/Logout HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
